 e that “human factor” an object of scientific study across the twentie
 th century its changing political regimes. Beginning with factory investig
 ations and suggestion systems in the 1930s\, it follows industrial psychol
 og\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-22 10:52 PDT
